/**
 * Notification is mostly a pure event consumer: it subscribes to kade.order.events,
 * kade.delivery.events, kade.merchant.events, kade.promotion.events, kade.ticket.events,
 * kade.ledger.events and kade.customer.events (and kade.rider.events when it exists), renders a
 * template and sends SMS / push / email through mock providers with retries and dead-letter topics.
 * The RPCs are for the few synchronous needs: OTP codes (profile), masked rider↔customer messages
 * (dispatch), staff invites, and push-token registration from the gateways. Publishes no events.
 */
